# Agent probe + snapshot artifacts (2026-09-02).
# A session driving the browser drops accessibility-tree dumps and throwaway probe
# specs into the tree. They are scratch, they are never reviewed, and one of them sat
# at the repo root failing docs:check. `bun run clean:workspace` relocates them into
# .playwright-mcp/, which has a 7-day retention.
/*.yml
!/.github/**/*.yml
e2e/zz-*.spec.ts

# Local tool artifacts — knowledge-graph / agent DB state, churns every session
ruvector.db
# graphify: the graph itself stays out (graph.json is 16MB and is rewritten in full on every
# build; cache/ and the HTML are derived). The markdown layer IS committed on purpose: cloud and
# web agents cannot run the graphify CLI, so wiki/ and GRAPH_REPORT.md are the only artifacts
# they can actually read. Needs `graphify-out/*`, not `graphify-out/`, because git cannot
# re-include a child once its parent directory is excluded.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/wiki/
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
agentdb*.rvf
agentdb*.rvf*.lock
agentdb*.lock
.swarm/

